OL,3,GNEWSAMP and council clash over large
OL,4,Aillegal waste dump
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has said Hinckley and Bosworth
OL,7,FBorough Council has serious questions
OL,8,Fto answer over a large illegal waste
OL,9,Fdump.
OL,11,FAbout 2,500 tonnes of domestic and
OL,12,Fcommercial waste was tipped on borough
OL,13,Fcouncil-owned land next to the A47 near
OL,14,FHinckley in August.
OL,16,FThe Liberal Democrat-run authority said
OL,17,Fserious organised criminals had
OL,18,Ftargeted the site.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
