OL,3,GNEWSAMP and council clash over large
OL,4,Aillegal waste dump
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, Dr Luke Evans, Tory MP for
OL,7,FHinckley and Bosworth, has written to
OL,8,Fcouncil leader Stuart Bray questioning
OL,9,Fwhether officials had done enough to
OL,10,Fsecure the site before the waste was
OL,11,Ftipped.
